{
  "title": "修改方法",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n<h1>修改方法</h1>\n<!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n<p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">在树视图中展开 <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Administration</span> 文件夹。</p>\n<!--?rh-list_end ?--><!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n<p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">单击 <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Methods</span> 节点，在主窗口中显示其默认页面。</p>\n<!--?rh-list_end ?--><!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n<p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">从网格中选择一行方法，然后单击主工具栏中的 <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Edit Item</span> <img src=\"/aras-images/image952.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"25\" height=\"29\" border=\"0\">。随即显示对话窗口。</p>\n<!--?rh-list_end ?--><!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n<p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">根据需要修改属性字段。</p>\n<!--?rh-list_end ?--><!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n<p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">单击 <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Save, Unlock, Close</span> <img src=\"/aras-images/image953.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" border=\"0\">。</p>\n<!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n<p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/image977.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"786\" height=\"485\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n\n<!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n\n\n\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Modifying_a_Method.htm"
}